{"type":"standard","title":"Abraham Hamadeh","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Abraham Hamadeh</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q124307977","titles":{"canonical":"Abraham_Hamadeh","normalized":"Abraham Hamadeh","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Abraham Hamadeh</span></span>"},"pageid":71031417,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/88/Abraham_Hamadeh.jpg/330px-Abraham_Hamadeh.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/Abraham_Hamadeh.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":3360,"height":4200},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1377679026","tid":"fbe34c17-bcdc-11f1-90dc-18d5313b6624","timestamp":"2026-09-30T14:41:13Z","description":"American politician and prosecutor (born 1991)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abraham_Hamadeh","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abraham_Hamadeh?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abraham_Hamadeh?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Abraham_Hamadeh"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abraham_Hamadeh","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Abraham_Hamadeh","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Abraham_Hamadeh?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Abraham_Hamadeh"}},"extract":"Abraham Jamal Hamadeh is an American politician, attorney, U.S. Army intelligence officer, and former prosecutor currently serving as the U.S representative for Arizona's 8th congressional district since 2025. A member of the Republican Party, he is the first Arab American elected to Congress from Arizona.","extract_html":"<p><b>Abraham Jamal Hamadeh</b> is an American politician, attorney, U.S. Army intelligence officer, and former prosecutor currently serving as the U.S representative for Arizona's 8th congressional district since 2025. A member of the Republican Party, he is the first Arab American elected to Congress from Arizona.</p>"}